@startuml component_diagram

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

left to right direction

package "TODO Application" {

    component "Entry Point\n(main)" as Main

    package "CLI Layer" {
        component "Interactive Menu" as IM
        component "Command-line Interface\n(TodoCLI)" as CLI
    }

    package "Service Layer" {
        component "Todo Service" as SVC
        component "Task Manager" as MGR
        component "Comments Service" as CSVC
        component "Comment Manager" as CMGR
        component "Statistics Service" as SSVC
        component "Import/Export Service" as IEXVC
    }

    package "Domain Model" {
        component "Task Model\n(Task, TaskStatus)" as Model
        component "Statistics Model\n(TaskStatistics)" as StatsModel
    }

    package "Persistence Layer" {
        component "JSON Storage\n(JsonStorage)" as Storage
    }
}

database "todo_data.json" as DB

Main --> IM : interactive mode
Main --> CLI : command mode

IM --> SVC
IM --> CSVC
IM --> IEXVC
CLI --> SVC
CLI --> CSVC
CLI --> IEXVC

SVC --> MGR
CSVC --> SVC
CSVC --> CMGR
SSVC --> SVC
IEXVC --> SVC
IEXVC --> CSVC
MGR --> Storage
CMGR --> Storage
MGR ..> Model
SSVC ..> StatsModel
Storage ..> Model

Storage --> DB : read/write

@enduml